    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josefu Yiivara Maloto ga Vahambe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wi vindu yivi, muhaani wi waini yu mwami wa Egebeti, kandi nu mudeeki munene weve, vahiola imbiri wu mwami wavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami wa Egebeti yaali nu vutima na vanene veve vaviri, muhaani wi waini kandi mudeeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalaga vaviikwi mu vuhambe, munyumba ya vanene va valindi, havundu ha Josefu yaali naveeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munene wa valindi yatovola Josefu kuva mulindi wa vahambe vandi vamenya mu vuhambe ku ing'inga indambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvudiku vulala muhaani wi iwaini kandi mudeeki, sa mulala yaali na maloto. Vuli maloto gaali ni kivuni chago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Josefu yaazaa kuvo mu zisa zia mugamba, yanyoora nivaveeye ni no vovereri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavateva, “Kigira ki muveeye novovereri kalunu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vamuvolera, “Vuli mulala ku kunyi yaali na maloto, na si aveeyeho mundu unyala kwivaala kivuni cha maloto yaga mba.” Josefu yavoola, “Nyasaye niyie ololekizaa kivuni cha maloto, mboleri maloto ginyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa mulindi wi iwaini yavolera Josefu, “Mu maloto gange, ndaalora muzabibu imbiri wange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gwaali ni zisia zivaga. Nonoho lwa matu gagwo gasivuka, vimuli viagwo vialoleka, kandi makuyu gagwo genga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaali ningumiyi kekombe chu mwami mu makono gange. Maku ndaavugura makuyu gu muzabibu ningamulira mu kekombe ma nimbana ku mwami.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Josefu yamuvolera, “Kivuni cha maloto yaga keveeye ndi: Zisia zivaga ziveeye madiku gavaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muing'inga ya madiku gavaga, mwami alakovoholora, kandi alakusamiiha nukukwiranyia ku miyinzi jijo. Ivi ulahaana iwaini ku mwami kuli wahaanaa maziambiri lwa waalange mulindi wi waini yeeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa yaanza unzizulizi lwa navove vulahi ku ivi; kandi ngogonya uyaanze ongonye mwami ayaanze yamboholore kutura munyumba ya vahambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligali inzi ndaagumilwa kutura mukivala cha Vaheburaina; kali hano mukivala cha Egebeti, si ndaakola kindu kali kilala kigira vambiki munyumba ya vahambe mba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwu mudeeki yalora ndi livaala lie kivuni cha maloto gu muhaani wi waini liali lilahi, yavolera Josefu, “Inzi kandi ndaali na maloto. Ndaali ni ng'ingi vihinda vivaga vie migadi ku mutwi gwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kihinda chaali kwigulu, vialimu viukulia viu mwami zing'ano ziosi, navuzwa manyonyi gaali nigaliza viukulia yivi ku mutwi gwange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu yativura, “Kivuni cha maloto yaga keveeye ndi: Vihinda vivaga viveeye madiku gavaga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu madiku gavaga, mwami alakovoholora, na alakala mutwi gwugwo! Maku alasunga muviri gwugwo ku musaala; na manyonyi galakalia zinyama ziu muviri gwugwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku lia kavaga, liali liu kwizuliza liivulwa liu mwami. Yalomba lilia linene ku vatumikiri veve vosi. Maku yalanga mulindi weve wi iwaini kandi mudeeki weve. Yavaleeta imbiri wa vatumikiri veve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiranyia mulindi wi iwaini muvutumiki vwivwe, ma yavugula iwaini nahaana ku mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa yasuunga mudeeki ku musaala kuli Josefu yaali navooye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulindi wi iwaini siyizuliza kokonya Josefu mba, yamwivirira ligali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
